# Multitenant Architecture

## Strategy

- Shared PostgreSQL database with `tenantId` column on tenant-scoped tables
- Tenant resolution via subdomain (`{slug}.tubarber.com`) or custom domain (Pro plan)
- Platform routes at `app.tubarber.com` under `(platform)` route group
- Tenant routes under `(tenant)` route group

## Roles

- `super_admin`: platform level, no tenantId, manages all tenants
- `admin`: tenant administrator
- `dueno`: shop owner within tenant
- `barbero`: barber within tenant

## Rules

- Never hardcode shop branding, hours, or messaging config globally
- All tenant-scoped data must include `tenantId`
- ManyChat config lives in `TenantSettings`; use platform fallback for Basic plan
- Cancel URLs must use tenant domain: `https://{slug}.tubarber.com/cancelar/{id}`
